pohoda-digest (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Customers without email/phone: only customers and supplier/customers are listed
    (Pohoda keys ODB / DOD+ODB; element names configurable by POHODA_KEY_CUSTOMER and
    POHODA_KEY_SUPPLIER)
  * Fix: e-mail, phone and company name of address book contacts are now read from the
    right place, so contacts that have an e-mail are no longer reported as missing it
  * MultiFlexi: the generated HTML report is registered as a job artifact (RESULT_FILE)
  * MultiFlexi: the applications declare MServer and Mail credential requirements

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:12:41 +0100

pohoda-digest (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Digest item limit: new DIGEST_ITEMS_LIMIT setting (default maximum
    number of items listed in each section, 0 = unlimited)
  * Czech localization: new DIGEST_LOCALE setting, Czech digest subjects
    and translated sections
  * Fix structured (array) values returned by Pohoda mServer being
    converted to strings

